后自动还原\n- **中英双语**：面板跟随 DSH 语言（`navigator.language`）——中文环境显示中文，英文环境显示 English\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
